        "A product that can be assembled at home or in a small workspace gives you more control over early iterations. A product that requires a factory, specialist tooling, and large purchase commitments can make every design change expensive.\n3.2 Prefer reversible manufacturing decisions early\nThe transcript contrasts 3D-printed enclosures with injection molding.",
