        "Possible content:\n- Show the problem in context.\n- Demonstrate the proposed mechanism.\n- Compare the current workaround with the concept.\n- Ask the target audience about their current solution.\n- Share a prototype and ask for specific feedback.\n- Explain the story behind the problem.\nMeasure more than views. Look for comments from the right people, questions about price or availability, direct enquiries, waitlist signups, and willingness to participate in interviews.",
        "A viral post can be interesting but commercially weak. A smaller post that attracts ten serious target customers may be more useful."
