        "Possible design questions:\n- Can a physical object make a digital action more deliberate?\n- Can a device remove a distracting behaviour?\n- Can a product make a routine easier to follow?\n- Can a physical interaction solve a problem that software alone does not?\nDo not copy a product's exact design or protected intellectual property. Study the underlying customer problem and develop a distinct, independently validated solution.\nPart VIII — A Practical Execution System"
